						<tr><td bgcolor=FFCC00><p class="pDate">Tuesday, November 27, 2001</p></TD></TR>
						<tr><td><BR><p class="pTitle">Guild List Update </p>
							<tr><td><p class=pText>
							FOr all of you that are visiting, please take a minute out and go to the "GUILDS" section.  See your Guild Listed?  If you do, please click on it and make sure the URL is ACCURATE.  If it is NOT accurate, please post a note here or under "SUBMIT NEWS ITEM".  Do NOT see your Guild listed and have web addy handy, again... please post a note here or under "SUBMIT NEWS ITEM".  I will be updating the list to complete accuracy.  If a Guild has an incorrect or non working web addy, I will be removing the URL and direct right back to this page.  Thanks for everyone's help who has given me information on their Guilds in game.  Much appreciated!  Let's all keep SolusekRo.com the Best it can be as well as Our Server!
Travel safe and Be well!  Adrastea
							<br>
							 - Adrastea<BR><BR>
							</p>
							<a class="abody" href="comments.asp?add=y&Index=194">[Add Comment]</a>&nbsp;
							&nbsp;<a class="abody" href="comments.asp?Index=194">[View Comments]</a>



					<BR><BR></TD></TR>
					
						<tr><td bgcolor=FFCC00><p class="pDate">Sunday, November 25, 2001</p></TD></TR>
						<tr><td><BR><p class="pTitle"> Hate  raid going on soon </p>
							<tr><td><p class=pText>
							 we are formally inviting Cult and Gathered might to a hate raid on decenber 7 8 and 9th   for a 3 day raid  courtsey of me to try to  get   more going on in the futureany one  in  any of the 3 guilds is welcome to come     once again   will be december 7 thru 9th   thanks  and  hope we  can get more going on soon
							<br>
							 - Gadgget  from Majestic partisans<BR><BR>
							</p>
							<a class="abody" href="comments.asp?add=y&Index=193">[Add Comment]</a>&nbsp;
							<BR><BR></TD></TR>
					
						<tr><td bgcolor=FFCC00><p class="pDate">Thursday, November 22, 2001</p></TD></TR>
						<tr><td><BR><p class="pTitle">EQ INFO! </p>
							<tr><td><p class=pText>
							Newly updated and NEW information compiled from many sources! Includes: Character Creation (on making a character) Information 

Jewelry 101 

Jewelry 201 

Jewelry 301 

Printable Jewelry Information Chart 

Level Chart for Antonica and Kunark

Level Chart for Faydwer, Odus, Velious and Planes

Stonebrunt Mountains Zone Pics and Info

Tradeskills (Baking, Brewing, Fletching & Pottery)

Velious Armor Quests

Velious Faction Info

Along with other info (such as the COMPLETE guide to completing parts 1-4 of the Coldain Prayer Shawl Quest) and other interesting info!

All are welcome to come check us out and see for YOURSELF why MANY have referred our site to others!

Kaah Chaang (guild leader)
Selias Trailtracker (Webster)
Adrastea Trailtracker (Guild Editor on this site and information compiler responsible for MANY happier players!)
May your travels be filled with surprises and without CRs!
							<br>
							 - Kaah<BR><BR>
							</p>
							<a class="abody" href="comments.asp?add=y&Index=192">[Add Comment]</a>&nbsp;
							&nbsp;<a class="abody" href="comments.asp?Index=192">[View Comments]</a>



					<BR><BR></TD></TR>
					
						<tr><td bgcolor=FFCC00><p class="pDate">Wednesday, November 21, 2001</p></TD></TR>
						<tr><td><BR><p class="pTitle">Selling In G-Fay </p>
							<tr><td><p class=pText>
							Im selling a ChetariWardstaff in G-Fay for 9k(sweet caster staff,includes 14int 8char 8 svmag and alot of other stats,effect:Knockback,22atk40
dly) and SilverChitinHandwraps for 8k(sweet monk hand item,30%haste,and some saves)and Azure Sleeves for 1k(also nice monk arm,12 ac 0.0wt)if interested speak to Majickal,Judukik, or Fuunky, send with decent offers for either monk or mage and PP is always nice. =)Im LF a IFS,PeaceBringer,2KD,2Wu'sTranceStick,or a combo of KD and Wu'sTranceStick and am willing to trade my stuff for it,along with PP if needed.=)
							<br>
							 - FunkadelicSuppaBard<BR><BR>
							</p>
							<a class="abody" href="comments.asp?add=y&Index=191">[Add Comment]</a>&nbsp;
							&nbsp;<a class="abody" href="comments.asp?Index=191">[View Comments]</a>



					<BR><BR></TD></TR>
					
						<tr><td bgcolor=FFCC00><p class="pDate">Friday, November 16, 2001</p></TD></TR>
						<tr><td><BR><p class="pTitle">GM event in SK </p>
							<tr><td><p class=pText>
							Tonight there was a mini GM event in South Karana.  Flaxxit Prot and Grabblik Kilb showed up thinking they were gonna set up an empire in our little zone but we proved them wrong.  Shouts screamed throughout the land sending some travellers running in fear while others gathered quickly to fight the duo.  Myself with about 20 fellow norrathians gathered together to rid the evil from the land.  After 25 minutes of battle, both had been slain.  Items that were looted included things such as a Shining Metalic Robe, Runed Circlet, Evil-Eye Backpack, Executioners Hood and about 45pp.
							<br>
							 - Phaldyne<BR><BR>
							</p>
							<a class="abody" href="comments.asp?add=y&Index=190">[Add Comment]</a>&nbsp;
